## Gel series

Twenty numbered Bubble Chip cousins, all in the same 16 colors. Written `%number%color%text%##`, where the number picks the style:

* `%1%color%text%##` Gel Bevels, a chunky 3D bevel: light top and left edges, deep bottom and right edges: %1%R%red%## %1%O%orange%## %1%GL%gold%## %1%Y%yellow%## %1%L%lime%## %1%G%green%## %1%TU%turquoise%## %1%T%teal%## %1%C%cyan%## %1%B%blue%## %1%PR%purple%## %1%PK%pink%## %1%W%white%## %1%FG%fog%## %1%SL%slate%## %1%BK%black%##
* `%2%color%text%##` Gel Stripes, candy stripes of gel running diagonally under a glossy wash: %2%R%red%## %2%O%orange%## %2%GL%gold%## %2%Y%yellow%## %2%L%lime%## %2%G%green%## %2%TU%turquoise%## %2%T%teal%## %2%C%cyan%## %2%B%blue%## %2%PR%purple%## %2%PK%pink%## %2%W%white%## %2%FG%fog%## %2%SL%slate%## %2%BK%black%##
* `%3%color%text%##` Gel Halos, clear glass with a soft glow of color all around it and gel glowing up from below: %3%R%red%## %3%O%orange%## %3%GL%gold%## %3%Y%yellow%## %3%L%lime%## %3%G%green%## %3%TU%turquoise%## %3%T%teal%## %3%C%cyan%## %3%B%blue%## %3%PR%purple%## %3%PK%pink%## %3%W%white%## %3%FG%fog%## %3%SL%slate%## %3%BK%black%##
* `%4%color%text%##` Gel Dots, little polka dots of gel on tinted glass: %4%R%red%## %4%O%orange%## %4%GL%gold%## %4%Y%yellow%## %4%L%lime%## %4%G%green%## %4%TU%turquoise%## %4%T%teal%## %4%C%cyan%## %4%B%blue%## %4%PR%purple%## %4%PK%pink%## %4%W%white%## %4%FG%fog%## %4%SL%slate%## %4%BK%black%##
* `%5%color%text%##` Gel Shelves, the gel rises from a thick colored shelf along the bottom: %5%R%red%## %5%O%orange%## %5%GL%gold%## %5%Y%yellow%## %5%L%lime%## %5%G%green%## %5%TU%turquoise%## %5%T%teal%## %5%C%cyan%## %5%B%blue%## %5%PR%purple%## %5%PK%pink%## %5%W%white%## %5%FG%fog%## %5%SL%slate%## %5%BK%black%##
* `%6%color%text%##` Gel Corners, the gel pools in the top-left corner, which is the one sharp corner: %6%R%red%## %6%O%orange%## %6%GL%gold%## %6%Y%yellow%## %6%L%lime%## %6%G%green%## %6%TU%turquoise%## %6%T%teal%## %6%C%cyan%## %6%B%blue%## %6%PR%purple%## %6%PK%pink%## %6%W%white%## %6%FG%fog%## %6%SL%slate%## %6%BK%black%##
* `%7%color%text%##` Gel Rings, a double ring edge around a gel glow in the middle: %7%R%red%## %7%O%orange%## %7%GL%gold%## %7%Y%yellow%## %7%L%lime%## %7%G%green%## %7%TU%turquoise%## %7%T%teal%## %7%C%cyan%## %7%B%blue%## %7%PR%purple%## %7%PK%pink%## %7%W%white%## %7%FG%fog%## %7%SL%slate%## %7%BK%black%##
* `%8%color%text%##` Gel Frames, a bright glassy frame just inside the colored edge: %8%R%red%## %8%O%orange%## %8%GL%gold%## %8%Y%yellow%## %8%L%lime%## %8%G%green%## %8%TU%turquoise%## %8%T%teal%## %8%C%cyan%## %8%B%blue%## %8%PR%purple%## %8%PK%pink%## %8%W%white%## %8%FG%fog%## %8%SL%slate%## %8%BK%black%##
* `%9%color%text%##` Gel Bands, a band of gel across the middle, fading to clear at the top and bottom: %9%R%red%## %9%O%orange%## %9%GL%gold%## %9%Y%yellow%## %9%L%lime%## %9%G%green%## %9%TU%turquoise%## %9%T%teal%## %9%C%cyan%## %9%B%blue%## %9%PR%purple%## %9%PK%pink%## %9%W%white%## %9%FG%fog%## %9%SL%slate%## %9%BK%black%##
* `%10%color%text%##` Gel Stitches, a stitched, dashed edge like a sewn-on patch: %10%R%red%## %10%O%orange%## %10%GL%gold%## %10%Y%yellow%## %10%L%lime%## %10%G%green%## %10%TU%turquoise%## %10%T%teal%## %10%C%cyan%## %10%B%blue%## %10%PR%purple%## %10%PK%pink%## %10%W%white%## %10%FG%fog%## %10%SL%slate%## %10%BK%black%##
* `%11%color%text%##` Gel Pebbles, a smooth, lumpy pebble shape: %11%R%red%## %11%O%orange%## %11%GL%gold%## %11%Y%yellow%## %11%L%lime%## %11%G%green%## %11%TU%turquoise%## %11%T%teal%## %11%C%cyan%## %11%B%blue%## %11%PR%purple%## %11%PK%pink%## %11%W%white%## %11%FG%fog%## %11%SL%slate%## %11%BK%black%##
* `%12%color%text%##` Gel Rulers, little ruler ticks along the bottom edge: %12%R%red%## %12%O%orange%## %12%GL%gold%## %12%Y%yellow%## %12%L%lime%## %12%G%green%## %12%TU%turquoise%## %12%T%teal%## %12%C%cyan%## %12%B%blue%## %12%PR%purple%## %12%PK%pink%## %12%W%white%## %12%FG%fog%## %12%SL%slate%## %12%BK%black%##
* `%13%color%text%##` Gel Waves, a scalloped wave of gel along the bottom: %13%R%red%## %13%O%orange%## %13%GL%gold%## %13%Y%yellow%## %13%L%lime%## %13%G%green%## %13%TU%turquoise%## %13%T%teal%## %13%C%cyan%## %13%B%blue%## %13%PR%purple%## %13%PK%pink%## %13%W%white%## %13%FG%fog%## %13%SL%slate%## %13%BK%black%##
* `%14%color%text%##` Gel Checks, a checkerboard of gel under a glossy wash: %14%R%red%## %14%O%orange%## %14%GL%gold%## %14%Y%yellow%## %14%L%lime%## %14%G%green%## %14%TU%turquoise%## %14%T%teal%## %14%C%cyan%## %14%B%blue%## %14%PR%purple%## %14%PK%pink%## %14%W%white%## %14%FG%fog%## %14%SL%slate%## %14%BK%black%##
* `%15%color%text%##` Gel Bookends, thick colored edges on both ends: %15%R%red%## %15%O%orange%## %15%GL%gold%## %15%Y%yellow%## %15%L%lime%## %15%G%green%## %15%TU%turquoise%## %15%T%teal%## %15%C%cyan%## %15%B%blue%## %15%PR%purple%## %15%PK%pink%## %15%W%white%## %15%FG%fog%## %15%SL%slate%## %15%BK%black%##
* `%16%color%text%##` Gel Sparkles, tiny white sparkles scattered over the gel: %16%R%red%## %16%O%orange%## %16%GL%gold%## %16%Y%yellow%## %16%L%lime%## %16%G%green%## %16%TU%turquoise%## %16%T%teal%## %16%C%cyan%## %16%B%blue%## %16%PR%purple%## %16%PK%pink%## %16%W%white%## %16%FG%fog%## %16%SL%slate%## %16%BK%black%##
* `%17%color%text%##` Gel Grids, graph-paper lines on tinted glass: %17%R%red%## %17%O%orange%## %17%GL%gold%## %17%Y%yellow%## %17%L%lime%## %17%G%green%## %17%TU%turquoise%## %17%T%teal%## %17%C%cyan%## %17%B%blue%## %17%PR%purple%## %17%PK%pink%## %17%W%white%## %17%FG%fog%## %17%SL%slate%## %17%BK%black%##
* `%18%color%text%##` Gel Insets, pressed into the page, with the shadow on the inside: %18%R%red%## %18%O%orange%## %18%GL%gold%## %18%Y%yellow%## %18%L%lime%## %18%G%green%## %18%TU%turquoise%## %18%T%teal%## %18%C%cyan%## %18%B%blue%## %18%PR%purple%## %18%PK%pink%## %18%W%white%## %18%FG%fog%## %18%SL%slate%## %18%BK%black%##
* `%19%color%text%##` Gel Glows, a neon glow inside and out, with glowing text: %19%R%red%## %19%O%orange%## %19%GL%gold%## %19%Y%yellow%## %19%L%lime%## %19%G%green%## %19%TU%turquoise%## %19%T%teal%## %19%C%cyan%## %19%B%blue%## %19%PR%purple%## %19%PK%pink%## %19%W%white%## %19%FG%fog%## %19%SL%slate%## %19%BK%black%##
* `%20%color%text%##` Gel Beads, a beaded, dotted edge: %20%R%red%## %20%O%orange%## %20%GL%gold%## %20%Y%yellow%## %20%L%lime%## %20%G%green%## %20%TU%turquoise%## %20%T%teal%## %20%C%cyan%## %20%B%blue%## %20%PR%purple%## %20%PK%pink%## %20%W%white%## %20%FG%fog%## %20%SL%slate%## %20%BK%black%##

